   "id": 648548,
   "is_answer_order_important": false,
   "stimulus_html": "",
   "stem_html": "<p>For questions 1 – 4, use the following:</p>\n<ul type=\"none\"><li>Function <span data-math=\"h\">h</span>&nbsp;describes the height of a ball, in inches, after <span data-math=\"n\">n</span><em>&nbsp;</em> by the equation <span data-math=\"h(n)=120 \\cdot (\\frac{4}{5})^n\">h(n)=120 \\cdot (\\frac{4}{5})^n</span>.</li></ul>\n<ol class=\"os-raise-noindent\">\n  <li>What is <span data-math=\"h(3)\">h(3)</span>? Round to the nearest integer. Think about what it represents in this situation.</li>\n</ol>",
   "answers": [],
   "hints": [],
